    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Journeybread contains a mix of fruits, nuts, and grains with an alchemical boost. Eating one journeybread provides all the food and water you need for a day. If you subsist on nothing else for a week, you become temporarily immune to journeybread until you eat real food and drink water normally for 24 hours.\n\nIn addition to the benefits of journeybread, power journeybread grants you a +1 item bonus to Athletics checks to Climb, Force Open, and Swim, and to Fortitude saving throws against being sickened. The number of minutes you can Hustle changes to your Constitution modifier × 20. These benefits last for 4 hours.\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Interact"
    },
